<?xml version="1.0"?>
<!--
Spartrak — extra cells for the PDP meta bar.

WHY THIS HANDLE AND NOT catalog_product_view.xml
The template these cells render in, Magento_Catalog::product/view/type/
default.phtml, is NOT bound to a block in the generic PDP handle. Magento
declares it per product TYPE:

    catalog_product_view_type_simple.xml        -> block product.info.simple
    catalog_product_view_type_virtual.xml       -> block product.info.virtual
    catalog_product_view_type_configurable.xml  -> block product.info.configurable

`product.info.stock.sku`, which reads like the obvious target, is a CONTAINER
(vendor/magento/module-catalog/view/frontend/layout/catalog_product_view.xml
line 41) — containers do not take <arguments>, so referencing it here would
have silently done nothing.

This catalogue is all Simple products (confirmed with the merchant,
2026-08-29), so this one handle covers it. If another product type is ever
introduced, copy this file to the matching handle above and change the block
name — nothing else, and no PHP.

WHAT IS BEING PASSED
The extra cells of the MOBILE meta bar (Figma 650:33782 — a 2x2 grid, against
the desktop's single row of two, 527:12990). Listed here, in the order Figma
draws them, rather than named inside the template: adding, reordering or
renaming one then costs a single line.

Each entry is a product attribute code. Labels come from the attribute's own
per-store-view label, so the admin owns the wording (CLAUDE.md §7), and a code
with no value on a given product simply renders no cell.

    attr_03d89377   "وحدة القياس" (unit of measure) — dropdown, created in
                    Admin on 2026-08-29. Magento auto-generated the code; it
                    is opaque on purpose, so it is written exactly once, here.

NOT LISTED: Figma's fourth cell, "العدد". The value it draws is "متوفر", in
the same green as the availability cell beside it — i.e. filler text rather
than a real value, which leaves the underlying field genuinely ambiguous
(stock quantity? pieces per pack?). Left out rather than guessed (CLAUDE.md §9,
no fake data). Add its code to the list below once the answer is in; nothing
else has to change.
-->
<page xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:noNamespaceSchemaLocation="urn:magento:framework:View/Layout/etc/page_configuration.xsd">
    <body>
        <referenceBlock name="product.info.simple">
            <arguments>
                <argument name="spartrak_meta_attributes" xsi:type="array">
                    <item name="unit_of_measure" xsi:type="string">attr_03d89377</item>
                    <item name="pieces_per_pack" xsi:type="string">pieces_per_pack</item>
                </argument>
            </arguments>
        </referenceBlock>
    </body>
</page>
